*> T9906 (lane 002-lane-p70b; docs/protocol/34-8 section 2.2 glow squid light, 21 section 4.5 and Appendix A entry 18): the client keeps a glow squid's dark ticks
*> remaining (Set Entity Data entry 18, INT) and lights it by GlowSquidRenderer.getBlockLightLevel: i = trunc(15 (1 - dark / 10)) clamped to 0 to 15, block light 15 when
*> i = 15, else max(i, the light of its cell). The counter falls 1 a tick (50 ms) from the value last set. In a world with no light (the cell's light is 0): dark 0 draws
*> the squid at full brightness, dark 5 at 7/15 (worked example E3 of the document), dark 100 at the floor of 0.1, and 100 ticks after a hit it glows again.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-GLOW-SQUID-DARK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 COPY CLCONST.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY CLMODELS.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-SQUID-ID            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROW-AREA            PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ID                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-INDEX               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-VALUE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BEST                FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-EYE-TABLE.
    05 WS-EYE              FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 3 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "CL-INIT" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO PK-COUNT
     CALL "ENTITY-ATLAS-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 256 TO PL-HEIGHT
     MOVE 0 TO SK-U PL-YAW
     MOVE 10 TO WS-EYE(1) WS-EYE(3)
     MOVE 64 TO WS-EYE(2)
     MOVE 1 TO CT-OPEN
     MOVE CT-TYPE-STANDARD TO CT-SET-TYPE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "glow_squid" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-SQUID-ID WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 7 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 10.5 TO WS-X
     MOVE 64 TO WS-Y
     MOVE 12.5 TO WS-Z
     MOVE 1000000 TO CL-NOW-MS
     CALL "GSD-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-SQUID-ID WS-X WS-Y WS-Z
     MOVE 18 TO WS-INDEX
     MOVE 0 TO WS-VALUE
     CALL "GSD-DATA" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-INDEX WS-VALUE
     PERFORM BRIGHTEST
     MOVE "glow squid with no dark ticks is drawn at full brightness (block light 15)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-BEST * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 5 TO WS-VALUE
     CALL "GSD-DATA" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-INDEX WS-VALUE
     MOVE "glow squid the dark ticks of entry 18 are kept" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-DARK(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     PERFORM BRIGHTEST
     MOVE "glow squid with 5 dark ticks left is lit to 7 of 15 (E3: i = 7)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 467 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-BEST * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Two ticks later 3 are left: i = trunc(15 x 0.7) = 10.
     COMPUTE CL-NOW-MS = 1000000 + 100
     PERFORM BRIGHTEST
     MOVE "glow squid the dark counter falls 1 a tick (3 left after 2 ticks: i = 10)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 667 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-BEST * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1000000 TO CL-NOW-MS
     MOVE 100 TO WS-VALUE
     CALL "GSD-DATA" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-INDEX WS-VALUE
     PERFORM BRIGHTEST
     MOVE "glow squid just hit (100 dark ticks) is drawn at the floor 0.1 in an unlit cell" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 100 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-BEST * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     COMPUTE CL-NOW-MS = 1000000 + 5000
     PERFORM BRIGHTEST
     MOVE "glow squid 100 ticks after the hit glows again (the counter reached 0)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N ROUNDED = WS-BEST * 1000
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.

*>   WS-BEST: the largest vertex brightness of the squid's mesh.
 BRIGHTEST.
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-BEST
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > RL-EN-COUNT
         IF RL-EN-B(WS-I) > WS-BEST
             MOVE RL-EN-B(WS-I) TO WS-BEST
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM.
 END PROGRAM TEST-GLOW-SQUID-DARK.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. GSD-SPAWN.
*> USING CLIENT-STATE, entity id, type (registry id), x y z (FLOAT-LONG): Add Entity at rest.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 1024.
 01 WS-ADD                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-UUID                PIC X(16) VALUE LOW-VALUES.
 01 WS-V0                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-V1                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-V2                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-A0                  FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TYPE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-X                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-Y                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-Z                    FLOAT-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-ID L-TYPE L-X L-Y L-Z.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-ID
     CALL "PB-PUT-UUID" USING PB-BUFFER WS-UUID
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-TYPE
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-X
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-Y
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-Z
     CALL "PB-PUT-LPVEC3" USING PB-BUFFER WS-V0 WS-V1 WS-V2
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-A0
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-A0
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-A0
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-ZERO
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "ENTITY-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE PB-BUFFER WS-ADD
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM GSD-SPAWN.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. GSD-DATA.
*> USING CLIENT-STATE, entity id, entry index, INT value: Set Entity Data with one INT entry.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY PROTO REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==MD-==.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 1024.
 01 WS-DATA                BINARY-LONG VALUE 101.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-INDEX                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-VALUE                BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-ID L-INDEX L-VALUE.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-ID
     INITIALIZE MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE L-INDEX TO MD-MD-INDEX
     MOVE MD-MDS-INT TO MD-MD-SERIALIZER
     MOVE L-VALUE TO MD-MD-INT
     CALL "PB-PUT-ENTITY-METADATA" USING PB-BUFFER MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE MD-MD-END TO MD-MD-INDEX
     CALL "PB-PUT-ENTITY-METADATA" USING PB-BUFFER MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "ENTITY-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE PB-BUFFER WS-DATA
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM GSD-DATA.


 COPY CLTEST.
